Clearance resume template: latex-jakes-compact ("LaTeX Jake's Compact")
Copyright 2026 Clearance. All rights reserved.

  Template id:      latex-jakes-compact
  Template version: 1.0.0
  Layout:          one column, centred header, small-caps section headings with a
                   horizontal rule, compact itemize, 10.5pt, 0.5in margins
  Attribution:     Clearance

Clearance template, original implementation. Inspired by Jake's Resume (MIT) and
sb2nov's resume (MIT), but no upstream source is copied: the document compiled at
render time is generated per resume by backend/src/render/latexExport.ts.

